{"text": "MEMORANDUM F dune 10, 1972\n\nSUBJECT: Operating Conmittee Meeting June 4, 1971\n\n\u2018he Operating Conmittce Meeting primarily revolved around a discussion\nOf product, Upon Mr, Heinann's questioning we detailed our work in\nproduct improvement first. We covered briefly the two projects completed-~\nSILVA THINS Menthol and PALL MAUL Menthol, We covered in detail the\nWAREYTON modification work to include the deletion of salt treated RC\nand the introduction of cusiny in the new RC, the adjustment of blend,\nthe adjustient of the chocolate/cocoa ratio, the use of extract Tonka\nversus synthetic coumarin, the change in plasticizer; and we covered in\ndetail the modification work in PALL MATA: Gold consistent with our PALL\nMALL Filter King product to Jnclude the use of a high quality RC, the\ndouble chocolate/cocoa and licorice levels, the addition of a Ninston\ntype flavor note, the change in plasticizer.\nWe covered in detail our product development work, Me briefly mentioned\nthe two projects comleted--7M0RICAN BRAND and PALL NALL Pilter King.\nWe Aiscussed in detail our accomplishments in Project LO and presented\nsamples of LUCKY TEN product. We discussed in detail our work in\nProject HC and presented samples of product in blind packages. We\n@iscussed in detail our accomplishments in Project WB to include the\nextraction of sten material, the use of brown sugar, the use of heavy\nbodied Bright and Burley tobaccos, the addition of menthone to menthol\nang the deletion of most of the conventional casing materials. Samples\nof product were presented in blind package\n\nWe stated in conclusion that we have developed a new products team\nwhich is heavily product oriented, which js most enthusiastic and\nparticularly improved in our work on flavors, We have also restructured\nour manufacturing and leaf services effort and through goo2 cooperation\nwith all Departments we have been able to achieve improvenents in\nservice, Finally we stated that our expanded tobacco operation should\nbe oa stream by the end of August in a production operation and that we\nhave used expanded tobacco in our Project LO product, Several additional\ndetailed questions were answered.\n\nKE Odarrns Cr Dlate persia AE BS\n\nTUR: jew", "words": [{"text": "MEMORANDUM", "x0": 61, "y0": 73, "x1": 129, "y1": 88, "conf": 63.0}, {"text": "F", "x0": 151, "y0": 74, "x1": 158, "y1": 87, "conf": 63.0}, {"text": "dune", "x0": 537, "y0": 74, "x1": 571, "y1": 83, "conf": 69.0}, {"text": "10,", "x0": 581, "y0": 73, "x1": 603, "y1": 85, "conf": 89.0}, {"text": "1972", "x0": 615, "y0": 73, "x1": 647, "y1": 83, "conf": 66.0}, {"text": "SUBJECT:", "x0": 62, "y0": 115, "x1": 126, "y1": 129, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "Operating", "x0": 146, "y0": 115, "x1": 221, "y1": 127, "conf": 8.0}, {"text": "Conmittee", "x0": 231, "y0": 115, "x1": 307, "y1": 125, "conf": 86.0}, {"text": "Meeting", "x0": 315, "y0": 115, "x1": 375, "y1": 127, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "June", "x0": 384, "y0": 116, "x1": 417, "y1": 125, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "4,", "x0": 427, "y0": 115, "x1": 441, "y1": 126, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "1971", "x0": 453, "y0": 115, "x1": 485, "y1": 125, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "\u2018he", "x0": 61, "y0": 158, "x1": 86, "y1": 167, "conf": 69.0}, {"text": "Operating", "x0": 96, "y0": 157, "x1": 171, "y1": 170, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "Conmittce", "x0": 180, "y0": 157, "x1": 255, "y1": 168, "conf": 87.0}, {"text": "Meeting", "x0": 265, "y0": 158, "x1": 324, "y1": 170, "conf": 85.0}, {"text": "primarily", "x0": 333, "y0": 157, "x1": 408, "y1": 170, "conf": 75.0}, {"text": "revolved", "x0": 418, "y0": 158, "x1": 485, "y1": 168, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "around", "x0": 495, "y0": 158, "x1": 545, "y1": 168, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "a", "x0": 555, "y0": 160, "x1": 562, "y1": 168, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "discussion", "x0": 571, "y0": 157, "x1": 656, "y1": 168, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "Of", "x0": 61, "y0": 171, "x1": 78, "y1": 181, "conf": 54.0}, {"text": "product,", "x0": 87